<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-CheckFree started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CheckFree started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan &amp; Co said it started coverage of software maker CheckFree Corp with a buy rating on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/16 to 18-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Checkfree's software is used to provide electronic commerce services.</p>
<p>-- The stock has been on a general uptrend since April, when it traded between $9 and $10 a share.</p>
</text>
